    "title": "Are Whales Selling Bitcoin For The Anthropic IPO? The SpaceX Playbook Hints A Bottom Is Near",
    "summary": "Bitcoin is bleeding ahead of the biggest AI listing in history. But if the market follows the script it wrote just five months ago, the selling could soon run out of fuel. BTC dropped below $67,000 this week, its weakest level since August, as investors pulled money from spot ETFs ahead of the Anthropic IPO. […]",
