    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "Bitcoin dropped below $67,000 this week, reaching its weakest level since August. Investors have been pulling money from spot ETFs ahead of the anticipated Anthropic IPO, raising questions about whether market participants are selling Bitcoin to fund investments in the upcoming artificial intelligence listing.",
